{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_35", "source_id": "63dcbffb0000000008025ddd", "title": "300元也能让油痘肌皮肤好到发光✨", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63dcbffb0000000008025ddd", "topic_family": "痘肌与痘印", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 925, "evidence_unit_count": 27, "original_evidence_unit_count": 27, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 92, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 我是小森林 这一期是油豆鸡评价晚间护肤 我会边护肤边给你们分享一些评价好用的护肤品", "因为酸可以让我们的皮肤变得很细腻光滑 它里面虽然还有一些舒缓控油的成分", "但是有很保湿 还有一点修护效果 一般像这种保湿的水 我都会上个两三遍", "又很容易明明 这个舒暗霜 就很适合我们油蜜皮 它的质地也是非常的清爽的", "这个有B5精华 开始后续都不服了 那我今天的分享 把B5睡下去啦 晚安", "舒缓缩红成分 而且因为我们第一步 有用过酸嘛 所以后续要配合用", "今晚先用一个凉茶水 这个很早之前我给你们分享过 它的刺底就是超清爽"], "retained_quotes": ["舒缓缩红成分 而且因为我们第一步 有用过酸嘛 所以后续要配合用", "今晚先用一个凉茶水 这个很早之前我给你们分享过 它的刺底就是超清爽"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63dcbffb0000000008025ddd/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63dcbffb0000000008025ddd/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63dcbffb0000000008025ddd/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63dcbffb0000000008025ddd/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "966d55bb4ec3fab80a44273eab8e574d11fadb34b1a3b1d56e1c968c62d87d4f", "card_hash": "6370014c039d84906318c06ed7ebfddee3519ef4ed4076f03a58156ac59e18b7", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_35", "source_id": "63d783b900000000080279c9", "title": "油痘肌护肤：从大牌追逐者变成实用护肤主义", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63d783b900000000080279c9", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 860, "evidence_unit_count": 21, "original_evidence_unit_count": 21, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["我长了9年的痘痘，曾经的额头密密麻麻全是闭口，前9年我的脸几乎没有一天是平整的", "在护肤品的选择上，希望油痘肌姐妹都清醒些，不要盲目追求大牌，一瓶5k块钱的贵妇面霜也许还不如50块的清爽面霜适合我们", "其实用s之前要去做针清，把闭口全清掉，因为s能加速皮肤新陈代谢，满脸闭口的情况下用s是会全脸爆痘的", "它只能清理表面的油脂，但让我们皮肤粗糙、堵塞、长闭口的其实是那些深层的油脂", "#如何拯救痘痘肌[话题]# #油痘肌护肤[话题]#", "在护肤品的选择上，希望油痘肌姐妹都清醒些，不要盲目追求大牌，一瓶5k块钱的贵妇面霜也许还不如50块的清爽面霜适合我们", "1⃣️不要盲目追逐品牌 看看皮肤的需求 曾经的我认为皮肤不好的原因肯定是用的不够贵，于是网上推一个我买一个"], "retained_quotes": ["在护肤品的选择上，希望油痘肌姐妹都清醒些，不要盲目追求大牌，一瓶5k块钱的贵妇面霜也许还不如50块的清爽面霜适合我们", "1⃣️不要盲目追逐品牌 看看皮肤的需求 曾经的我认为皮肤不好的原因肯定是用的不够贵，于是网上推一个我买一个"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63d783b900000000080279c9/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63d783b900000000080279c9/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63d783b900000000080279c9/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_63d783b900000000080279c9/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "f3fa9f0cc23be69e318b35cd50c53473ae706165bb23c1fca2748eb5e3121afe", "card_hash": "d88ed753f12d51e1e5eb593f1d20176